# LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every machine.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` writes CRLF into
# the working tree while the blobs stay LF, and `pnpm lint` fails on all 73
# files with a formatting error nobody introduced — Biome formats to LF. The
# committed content is unchanged either way; this only stops the checkout from
# rewriting it on the way out.
* text=auto eol=lf
